  "translation": "Yenna-yas: Ɛud-i, ma ulac aɣilif, axaṭef lexḍer-a n tmecṭult-nneɣ i llan deg temdint, gma d-neffa fell-i. Ihi tura, ma kifanyiɣiɣ deg tiḥmum-ik, ad rrbeɣ, ma ulac aɣilif, ad waliɣ ⟨את⟩ watmaten-iw; ɣef wayagi i ur ikeccmen ara ar tfellaḥt n ugellid.",
